  "claim_scope": "The complete actual CP99 born Frame B is recovered from its existing runtime/native full Model before projection. Its explicit calculationReader is preserved through the existing Inventory.programme, making actual actionReader/actualMaterial.raw the original one-R/split source on B current p. The actual actionResultAt generates full S(p), source state2 retains (Rp,0), source Trace has length3, and the pair sum is Rp. The actual B paid/mathNext edge preserves (p,0), including registered input and existing Configured receiver environment. The existing Configured compiler/whole/target_next/runtime_source_gate/actual query consumes this same registered source edge and complete scalar/pair inventories. The registered Native input remains the exact residual expression raw-material.state.1, with its separate budget; no updated total-pair decoder or equality with the prior CP99 macro next is asserted.",
  "kind": "shared source-selector propagation plus actual whole Frame recovery and registered source action, consumed by the existing Configured successor/runtime",
  "certified_machine_facts": [
    "All seventeen necessary production/dependency modules independently pass fresh trust0/warningAsError: two changed shared owners, eight affected tracked downstream modules, six newly needed existing Configured/Clock modules and the new domain producer. The exact new direct gate and original CP99 direct regression also independently pass.",
    "The seventeen refreshed source artifacts are the exact source/import inverse dependency requirement of this focused graph. All 1225 unaffected dependencies are reused only by formal recursive source/import/compiler/OLean/sidecar signature equality. No old CP97 broad chain is rebuilt and no parent construction farm supplies certified dependencies.",
    "The production graph contains 1242 local modules; the new direct gate has 1243; the union with original CP99 regression has 1244. All 1239 nonowned source snapshots match current HEAD with zero deltas. Three owned production main OLeans are byte-identical to the frozen export.",
    "The twenty-four new direct consumer/control proof bodies and thirteen original CP99 control bodies are captured by exact private header-only clones and independently kernel checked. Their complete type/value/constructor/recursor graph contains 73834 declarations; the source primitive graph contains 71433. All twenty-one new printed mouths, eight original regression mouths and the full graph use exactly std3; unsafe, partial, unresolved and sorryAx are zero.",
    "The shared Installation diff is exactly one field: calculationReader is passed from the actual sourceFrame datum. The stock reader, retained lowResult decoder, source component and both inventory callbacks are preserved. Stock.registered_raw is restricted to its actual epoch datum None case and directly consumed with that precise fact.",
    "Default originalProgramme None, explicit Some source, and shape-matching original CP99 R/split code with None are directly checked. The source selector controls routing; expression shape does not. The old CP99 exact gate still passes under the changed shared dependency and its eight axiom outputs remain std3.",
    "The existing runtime at priorReceipt.distance+1 is decoded by Native.Frame.read. recovered_born identifies the entire generated B Frame, and full_model_born reads the actual native Model into Finsupp.single B. Root, actual occurrence, active environment and both complete inventories are recovered before dependent source projection.",
    "B current input is the actual new p=original physicalProjection(R(v)), while its prebirth rawRead is preserved separately. The Some action reader consumes epoch(B).activeEnvironment=(p,0); actualMaterial.raw is the original code. actionResultAt generates both coordinates S(p)=(physicalProjection(Rp),literal physicalPerp(Rp)), retaining the complete raw Rp and source trace3.",
    "The source state is connected to the original CP99 executor by existing common_raw_state with the same supplied raw input. paid_R_state reads full (Rp,0) before the actual split. This lawful source transport does not identify distinct roots/occurrences or provide a target commuting equality as input.",
    "The actual born settled branch is excluded by the generated SourceRegisteredClaimClock remainder and source request budget; born_next_paid therefore gives the actual mathNext edge. after_born_environment and registered_environment preserve (p,0), and the actual Configured lowInitial receiver is tied to the same registered input and environment.",
    "The actual registered input is Native.ResidualRequest.expression=raw plus the negated paid-state expression. It is not naked R/split. The direct existing budget consumer preserves remaining(raw)+remaining(material.state.1)+2, independently of source trace fee3. Full S(p) remains source material; the native residual output is not renamed the next R pair.",
    "The actual existing Configured.state.compileInquiry yields its generated debtAdmission; configured_whole, configured_next, configured_runtime and configured_query directly consume that generated action target/next/receiver. The receiver scalar and pair inventories and the original born_complete_inventory/generated_source_return consumers are directly checked.",
    "The source constructor uses the original observation/nontrivial/source Half and actual Frame environment. No caller physicality, cancellation, nonzero, terminal, coverage, selected target or future decoder is supplied. No primitive closure reaches a new conclusion theorem or consumer target backwards.",
    "The new production mathematical body is independently byte-identical to the frozen maximal splice after only namespace/qualification and source/gate partition. Production has no diagnostics, examples, unauthorized axiom or scratch/Verification import. Tracked registered_raw callers are only its definition and StockQuery export/print, with no proof caller."
  ],
  "source_input_audit": {
    "primitive": "Existing CP99 lowProgramme plus explicit source calculationReader; only original observation/nontrivial/source Half and actual Frame environment enter, no target/physical/zero/terminal/coverage witness.",
    "routing": "Inventory.programme passes calculationReader from its actual sourceFrame datum while retaining independent stock reader, actual lowResult decoder and both original inventory callbacks. registered_raw now has correct actual-epoch None precondition.",
    "recovery": "Existing CP99 runtime stateAt(priorReceipt.distance+1) is decoded by Native.Frame.read; recovered_born identifies the entire generated B Frame. full_model_born reads the actual source Model to Finsupp.single B before environment/source projections.",
    "current_input": "B has new p=physicalProjection(R(v)) active environment, derived from CP99 actual_physical_next. B.rawRead remains prebirth; the new action reads epoch(B).activeEnvironment=(p,0).",
    "actual_source_action": "actual actionReader/actualMaterial.raw is the original one-R/split AST. actionResultAt directly generates S(p)=(physicalProjection(Rp),physicalRemainder(Rp)), sourceState retains full (Rp,0) before split, source Trace length3 and pair sum recovers Rp.",
    "same_occurrence_transport": "common_raw_state transports between actual source roots/visits with the same supplied raw input. No root equality, different occurrences identification or target commutes input is assumed.",
    "native_input": "Native.ResidualRequest.expression is raw-material.state.1; it is not naked R/split. afterEnvironment/registered input/Configured receiver preserve (p,0) on actual B paid/mathNext edge. Full S(p) remains actual source material; native residual value cannot be renamed S(p) or source0.",
    "budgets": "Source var/R/split cost3 is distinct from native remaining(raw)+remaining(paidState)+2; direct budget consumer covers native expression. No physical strict payment or Bochner cost is inferred.",
    "true_consumer": "Configured.state.compileInquiry, whole_first, target_next, actual_initial/runtime_source_gate, receiver current/registered/env/inventories and actual next query are existing consumers at recovered B with the new configuration.",
    "two_macro_scopes": "Prior CP99 Shared.nextBorn produces B; the new Configured action has its own actual generated target/next. Neither is identified with the other or original physical UnitHistory.",
    "future_decoder": "No own-runtime updatedPair decoder or infinite registered physical iteration is signed; CP101 is separate."
  },
  "scope_limits": {
