    "two_macro_scopes": "CP99 Shared.nextBorn produces recovered B. This new Configured action has its own actual target/next/runtime. They are not identified with one another, original physical UnitHistory or a uniform new clock.",
    "next_environment_and_decoder": "This exact B edge preserves (p,0); no own-runtime updatedPair decoder, total pair recovery through that decoder or infinite registered physical feed is signed.",
    "budgets": "Source AST fee3, Native residual budget and original physical root debt are distinct. No primitive-internal Bochner cost, new physical strict payment or controller advance is inferred.",
    "whole_source": "Both coordinates and source paid Trace are preserved; faithful residual zero is not used as constructor input, source zero, cancellation, no-next gate or U8/no-go authority.",
    "optional_old_gate": "StockQuery was not rerun by the independent verifier. The author recorded a missing Actor.Action artifact outside this exact graph, not PASS. The changed default mouth is directly consumed by the new gate and original CP99 regression passes; no Actor branch refresh is claimed."
